ime walk through the garden, yield to scheduled work, and check for volunteer hours or a campus-led activity.","short_summary":"A working garden and outdoor kitchen supporting learning, food, and community programs.","evidence_claim":"The Knoll offers an educational garden, outdoor kitchen, and serenity garden, and hosts gardening hours, internships, classes, and events.","source_url":"https://www.middlebury.edu/sustainability-environmental-affairs/get-involved/knoll","source_title":"The Knoll | Middlebury","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Small casual gatherings are welcome, but guests should yield to staff, volunteers, and reserved groups; the site operates seasonally from roughly April 1 to November 1.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"trail-around-middlebury","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Trail Around Middlebury","title":"Choose a TAM segment","subtitle":"18-mile loop around the town of Middlebury","notes":"Pick a short, well-marked segment for daylight, bring water, and use one of the town access points rather than attempting the whole loop.","short_summary":"A multi-access trail loop through woods, fields, and Otter Creek scenery.","evidence_claim":"The Trail Around Middlebury is an 18-mile loop with multiple access points that circles town through forests, fields, and along Otter Creek.","source_url":"https://www.middlebury.edu/middlebury-outdoor-programs/outdoor-resources","source_title":"Outdoor Resources | Middlebury Outdoor Programs","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Conditions, daylight, and trail surfaces vary by segment and season; select an appropriate route and prepare accordingly.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"middlebury-panthers-home-event","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Middlebury Panthers home athletic event","title":"See what the Panthers are playing","subtitle":"Middlebury College Athletics schedule","notes":"Use the official schedule to choose a home contest, confirm the venue and start time, and follow the event’s posted spectator guidance.","short_summary":"A chance to connect with current varsity competition across Middlebury’s sports facilities.","evidence_claim":"Middlebury Athletics publishes schedules for its varsity teams and lists campus athletic facilities and event information.","source_url":"https://athletics.middlebury.edu/","source_title":"Middlebury College Athletics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Schedules and spectator access change by sport and date; verify the specific event page before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
